# Chiral HCFClBr, PBE0/def2-SVP, TDA with all the amplitudes printed (tprint 1e-6): velocity and magnetic
# transition dipoles and both rotatory strengths, for the transition dipole pictures (27/11/2026)
! PBE0 def2-SVP NoUseSym
%pal nprocs 2 end
%output
 Print[ P_Basis ] 2
 Print[ P_MOs ] 1
end
%tddft
 nroots 10
 tda true
 tprint 1e-6
end
